  "ingredients": [
    "3 red potatoes",
    "2 eggs",
    "1.5 cups creamy salad dressing"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xsio5iDRQ9PkX0ubW-ZgehkE7Xk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-14430-simple-potato-salad-VAT-step-01-28f0d768f1b0454f9b68c2095fdc45a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14430/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a small pot of salted water to a boil. Add potatoes; cook until tender but still firm, about 15 minutes. Drain and cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Qr73kaMqhFaTV6BOlexToToc3Ys=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-14430-simple-potato-salad-VAT-step-02-25e57e193f454d64944d7c574d475e98.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14430/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place eggs in a saucepan, and cover completely with cold water. Bring water to a boil. Cover, remove from heat, and let eggs stand in hot water for 10 to 12 minutes. Remove from hot water, and cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/stkr85sSZiOFy1tZf4FQHfuXX6M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-14430-simple-potato-salad-VAT-step-03-d5d1ac3eff4b4b71b21cfcd46734dc04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14430/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel the eggs and cut around the egg white; keep the yolk whole.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/115JFEto3byC-ZwLuKfoJhlYxvQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-14430-simple-potato-salad-VAT-step-04-3-b19dc03d27fb458ba29fa4001e22b52e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14430/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dice egg whites and potatoes. Combine in a mixing bowl and add salad dressing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yZP7QBnVTRbVurJTNG7sHPG5NmY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-14430-simple-potato-salad-VAT-step-05-80a23ab2834d49db8067f2a7ca6667cf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14430/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss potatoes and egg; crumble egg yolk on top and serve chilled.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mU7gPjiAOb08iSp_f1xV6pDjrPI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-14430-simple-potato-salad-VAT-step-06-d9c2b1ba97b846ff8ce94875a9803a0f.jpg"
